{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object is detected then move, take and check it. Finally, perform a specific task. list of available nodes: <Action ID = MoveToObject    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObjects    /> <Action ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <SubTree ID = PerformSpecificTask    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectDetected    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectInRange    />",
